# No personal information

This repository is public. Docs, code, comments, commit messages, and plans must not mention:

- The author's other projects, employers, or accounts
- The author's familiarity with tools, languages, or stacks
- Names, usernames, emails, or any other personal detail

Write recommendations in terms of the project (constraints, fit, trade-offs), not the person working on it.
